between. No, you know, how many dollars are coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:56.000
in? And they were in trouble. So what the Trump&nbsp;
campaign started doing in September was to set up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.240
recurring donations for online donors so that&nbsp;
the donations would keep happening every week&nbsp;&nbsp;

